160
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:06,122
Scott: That's right.

161
00:12:07,427 --> 00:12:21,940
Scott: But anyway, I haven't seen any of them and the reason I don't see them, I mean, there might be something to enjoy in them, right, is mainly is that the things that I enjoy about comic books, I know that those movies do not have those things.

162
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:24,720
Rym: Yeah, it's not gonna be trippy Secret of Space.

163
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:39,320
Scott: Right, they do not have the parts, I enjoy Marvel comics a lot, many of them, but I know for a fact that those movies contain the parts of the comics that I do not enjoy, so I'm not particularly motivated to go see them.

164
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:46,280
