165
00:12:48,882 --> 00:12:50,480
Scott: Fantastic Four has a chance.

166
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:55,099
Rym: For the sole reason of the aesthetic that it appears to be.

167
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:57,079
Scott: Fantastic Four has a chance.

168
