Rym: this doesn't happen way more often.

186
00:14:24,561 --> 00:14:27,060
Scott: Along with, you know, the new Arkane that Rym loves.

187
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:29,640
Rym: Oh God, Arkane 2, I am more excited.

188
00:14:30,002 --> 00:14:37,960
Rym: The only thing I am more excited to see in terms of animated media than Arkane 2 is Spider-Verse 3.

